OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigation of Creswell
OL,4,Aindecent exposure allegation 'failed
OL,5,Avictim'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,8,F(PSNI) investigation into an allegation
OL,9,Fof indecent exposure made against
OL,10,FJonathan Creswell in 2016 was
OL,11,Finadequate and failed the victim, the
OL,12,FPolice Ombudsman has found.
OL,14,FCreswell took his own life in 2024
OL,15,Fwhile on trial for the murder of
OL,16,F21-year-old Katie Simpson in 2020,
OL,17,Fwhich he had denied.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
