OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigation of Creswell
OL,4,Aindecent exposure allegation 'failed
OL,5,Avictim'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Police Ombudsman said it
OL,8,Fsubsequently received a complaint from
OL,9,Fa woman raising concerns about how
OL,10,Fpolice dealt with a report she made
OL,11,Fthat Creswell exposed himself to her.
OL,13,FIn a statement, the PSNI said "the
OL,14,Factions of the officers involved did
OL,15,Fnot meet the expectations of the PSNI
OL,16,For the victim".
